 profile lock and outside the §2.2 allowlist, while claude_code runs only the profile set under --strict-mcp-config. The asymmetry is not stated.\n\nImplementation verification (TASK-260916-dv7xv5 rev3, curator main 80483355, launcher main b34e1e27, static): confirmed. Seeds: []string{\"config.toml\"} (envregistry.go:219); gatherSeeds reads the native file whole (managed.go:570-584) and the plan writes the bytes unchanged at provisioning (:887-893); the other mcp_servers paths are the profile layer renderer (contextmaterialize/mcp.go:231-240) and the read-only home verifier (mcp/mcp.go:253), neither touches the seed. Strip or report belongs in gatherSeeds and the registry seed row."}}]}
